          <view class="cg-adv-grid">
            <view><input class="cg-cfg-input" value="{{advanced.coinFlip.tails.label}}" placeholder="叫什么，如 反面" data-section="coinFlip.tails" data-field="label" bindinput="onAdvancedField" /></view>
            <view><input class="cg-cfg-input" value="{{advanced.coinFlip.tails.action}}" placeholder="那就做什么，如 这杯你请" data-section="coinFlip.tails" data-field="action" bindinput="onAdvancedField" /></view>
          </view>
          <view class="cg-cfg-hint">「正面 / 反面」本身没有意义，写上「这杯店家请 / 这杯你请」才是一个玩法。本次朝哪面由系统决定——本机随机结果可以被改动。</view>
        </view>
          </view>
          <view class="cg-gcfg" wx:if="{{gameSection === 'diceRoll'}}">
        <view class="cg-adv-body">
          <view class="cg-cfg-label">标题</view>
          <input class="cg-cfg-input" value="{{advanced.diceRoll.kicker}}" placeholder="{{advanced.diceRoll.mode === 'd20' ? '例如 能否找到暗门' : '例如 掷到几就做第几件事'}}" data-section="diceRoll" data-field="kicker" bindinput="onAdvancedField" />
